																		Thanks, Attribution, and Other Matters
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrwrong" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2039383); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2039383&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607892295" alt="MrWrong" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2039383)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrwrong" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2039383); return false;" >MrWrong</a></span> <span class="odate time_1442976710 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">23 Sep 2015 02:51</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2380150">
									

<p>This is my attempt at a Sarkicist SCP. I would like to thank all the people who had reviewed it, like psul and Amuness etc. Especially, I wish to thank Metaphysician for his openness to this concept which I have suggested.</p>
<p>Metaphysician pretty much did the skeleton of it (basic concept of the Vatula), although I'm the one who added the flesh to the piece and made it an SCP.</p>
<p>Attribution-wise, this article has the following references:</p>
<ul>
<li>SCP-2406 (&quot;The Colossus&quot;) by Metaphysician</li>
<li>SCP-029 (&quot;Daughter of Shadows&quot;) by TheDuckman</li>
<li>SCP-140 (An Incomplete Chronicle) by AssertiveRoland</li>
<li>Wrong Proposal (The Consensus) by MrWrong</li>
</ul>
<p>Image is attributed to Archit Ratan of Flickr (<a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/architratan/7378338908">https://www.flickr.com/photos/architratan/7378338908</a>) under CC BY 2.0.</p>
<p>And a few more things&#8230;</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>The Vatula/Karcist Vaski are basically reincarnating themselves since Karcist Vaski went to India. With each generation (cycle of reincarnation), less of their sanity is retained over time. By the time the Foundation discovers them, most SCP-2833 instances barely remember who they are and it is reasonable to say they're lunatics at this point.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

